# Ignore everything by default and re-include only what the build reads:
# the Go module files and the source trees. Whole directories are
# re-included, so files a package embeds (go:embed) come along.
**

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!api/

# Tests are not built into the image.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
